<description>&lt;p&gt;U.S. soldiers are now operating in Ecuador alongside local forces against cartels, extending the security fight beyond urban areas. A fishing vessel off Ecuador's coast was attacked, killing multiple people and showing violence moving to the maritime domain. Cartel groups continue to clash with security forces on land, while threats and intimidation are reported at a mining company linked to a wealthy Australian individual. Two battle-related deaths were recorded in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxNeEFWMGlqekJFZ3lFYm5GeEhnRzdWQ2ZVa2tPS1lob3ZKaXlMS1FMMjRZUmx0aDBNbkdIR1pvTktJZTAwQ0FBdU85VWd6aXRqb0k0ZHZ3UnlubGNJT1lVY1lleU1RNk1FWHJGSlhrcnZFbVhkSXFNdDlmR1RQcHVsbEo3VG9VVVFHTXIwUGhpRGdhTkRxS2FCY192TWhnRy1vNVRMd0h3?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxPajZUbGM0RmUtdjZzdzRFSmhBQ3dsc3k2bXlwYndqd2FJc2JDZjhBMFE5di1FUFR1NTRRLTZiZzZsM0tsN1BJQ3JzV01LbFdDbWduMnNENDB5QmZkODRzbWVxTWF3cF9ucU5vZmpjbjJULWltMWpIVWxBTzFWRWlxeQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxPNDlOc01aeWJuUXNQN0d1V1VoeVByNVVYX04xeTREN3oxZWRqWU5NaWVjVHJtdEtrTWlHdGdPSmVLUXc1Sm1ubUU0ZVkwSk1SWmREeUN4UnoxOWlyeGQxdzBRR2gyT3YwVmF1VzlsNFlSRU5ndzNsTGVKQWNyZU5aRA?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ukrinform&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxNdGZobkppWDhVYjFrLVhka29LeHBpNWI3NkFJSjQxRkpicGpMZ1hHNW5MTWdGamJ6Sy1TUWhGNGZLZ2pwdmpSWS1pMGw2U3JTaHBqRzJaMUdDOXJTeTFTQlVoN09zUEk0WUlKdWVNYTlsdlRpb1J2S29FTFZISDItTVRsU19pTTBpVmNzWUZiNTJVLTF4M0oxZzVrYTBtcjBQZnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;CBS News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxQN0tJdF9WVHY4aFhPcnNuTzFmTXV0T2hRSlp6SD